  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 207.01 Applicablility. These rules shall apply to the conduct of hearings held by the board to provide information and receive public comment in any matter that is not a contested case as defined by RSA 541-A:1, IV.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
